# TypeScript / Bun conventions

## ESM imports

Use `.js` extensions in relative imports (TypeScript `moduleResolution: bundler`):

```typescript
// ✅
import { Controller } from "./controller.js";

// ❌
import { Controller } from "./controller";
```

## Tests

- Runner: `bun test` (not jest/vitest).
- Import test API from `bun:test`.
- Integration tests live in `packages/testing/src/integration/`; use `FakeLuaPeer` instead of live BizHawk when possible.

## Types

- Shared wire/state types → define in `@bizshuffle-bun/protocol` (Effect Schema), re-export from package index.
- Prefer `type` imports for types-only symbols.

## Formatting

Prettier is authoritative for style (`prettier.config.mjs`). ESLint is non-strict; do not re-enable strict stylistic rules without discussion.
